WEBVTT

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:40.570
Kousonsan, Kousonsan...
I just can't remember.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.640
I can see the city!

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.500
That's the town that Kousonsan-san
rules, isn't it?

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.490
Yeah. We're finally here.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:56.470
I hope the sword that Hakukei-chan
found is mine.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:01.450
<b>Episode 3
Kousonsan
Fights Enshou!</b>

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.830
I remember this road!

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:07.430
If you keep going, you'll reach
the village where I grew up.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:11.640
This is where Aisha told
me her given name.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.400
That's right, Rin Rin.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.140
I'm amazed you remember.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.590
Isn't that Shakudouzan Mountain?

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:20.110
Yeah, you and I went there
to fight bandits.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:21.700
Um...

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:26.590
Is it true that, to sneak in, you both hid in a small,
cramped box, squirming atop each other?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.890
Sei, what did you tell her?

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.540
Merely the truth.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.780
Chou'un-dono, Kan'u-dono, Chouhi-dono.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:37.620
Are you here to speak to our lord today?

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.340
Yes, tell her we're here to see her.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.600
Of course. Kan'u-dono, your black
hair is as pretty as always.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.310
Excuse me.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:48.000
You're so famous as the black-haired
bandit hunter.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.270
They were really praised you
about it last time, too!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.440
Yeah.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.230
Just the black hair, though...

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.290
Hey, guys.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:02.830
Oh, Touka!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.910
Why are you traveling with
Kan'u and her group?

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.000
Actually, Hakukei-chan...

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:10.340
Hey, the two of us are closer than that.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:16.510
Use my given name, just like you did back
when we put our desks together in school.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:17.860
Huh?

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.260
What's wrong?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.950
You haven't forgotten it, have you?

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:24.570
O-Of course I remember it!

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.160
Umm... it's...

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.630
Pa-Pa-Pa...

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.220
Paipai-chan!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:32.660
It's Pairen!

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:35.530
That's what I called you when
we were little, so I just...

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.460
That was when we were little!

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.740
Call me Pairen from now on.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.360
Anyway, it's really been a while, hasn't it?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:48.470
Yeah, remember when we went to
Roushoku-sensei's place to play?

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:49.550
Yeah!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:52.070
Wait, were you there then, Paipai-chan?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.540
It's Pairen!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.130
We went picking flowers together!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.370
I remember the flower picking...

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.150
What's wrong, Sei?

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:07.130
Watching that makes me feel pretty bad for all those
jokes about how hard she is to remember.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:13.770
That's true. Ryuubi-san might actually be worse
than you 'cause she doesn't mean any harm.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.830
I remember!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.940
This girl is Kousonsan.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:27.500
Th-That aside... Chouhi, Kan'u, Chou'un, it's been
a long time since I've seen you, as well.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.450
Who is this?

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.080
Oh, is she your child, Kan'u-dono?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.540
N-No!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.590
That's right! Aisha has never been in the kind
of relationship that could result in kids-

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.870
You're not helping!

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.830
The sword isn't here?

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.280
You see,

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.200
my lands were struck by a
horrible famine last year.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:52.090
We made do for a while, but I
eventually ran out of options.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:56.810
And, just a few days ago, I went to
Enshou to borrow some foodstuffs.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.430
But she'd heard of the sword
I'd found and said that,

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:07.310
while she'd lend me the food, I'd have to give
her the sword until I could repay her.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.410
So you left it there?

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.390
I'm sorry!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.740
If I'd known it was yours,
I wouldn't have done it.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:17.900
It can't be helped.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:18.860
You didn't know.

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:21.740
No, now that I think of it...

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:26.970
That brilliantly crafted scabbard,
that sparkling red jewel embedded in the tip...

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:31.600
It was definitely the scabbard that I saw
at your house when we were little.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.480
I should've noticed.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.910
It's fine.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:42.870
And you did it to save the people
who were starving, right?

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.080
Then I can't complain.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.020
Touka...

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:49.240
Yeah.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.870
Regardless of the situation, if the sword's
not here, there's no point in staying.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.290
We wasted a trip of several days.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.450
I never thought that it would
vanish on our way here.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:09.430
I don't know if she'll give it back, but our only option
now is to go to Enshou-san and petition her.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:14.550
Then I'll go with you and ask her, too.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:16.240
Thank you, Paipai-chan!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.790
It's Pairen!

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.270
Maybe I should give up on swimsuits
that bare my stomach...

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.790
Toshi!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.020
Hey, Iishe!

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.530
Knock first!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.490
Someone's here for Reiha-sama.
Do you know where she is?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.480
The usual place, I'm sure.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:53.290
There, there, that's just right.

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:56.070
Harder, harder!

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.240
Reiha-sama!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.660
What is it, Iishe?

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.320
Don't interrupt my relaxation time.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:09.070
Why not? You spend all your
time relaxing anyway.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.510
What did you say?!

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:14.480
Um, Kousonsan-dono's been waiting...

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:15.790
I know.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:21.410
That impoverished viceroy... She
can wait as long as we please.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.990
Oh, Kan'u-san. You're here, too?

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:33.140
You're late, Enshou!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.340
How long were you going to make us wait?

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:40.730
Oh, Kousonsan-san, aren't you being a
little haughty, given your debt to me?

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.270
Um, Enshou-san...

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.850
You're Ryuubi-san?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.150
I've heard your story.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.280
You want me to return
that blade, don't you?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.760
Yes.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.180
No.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:08:00.000
That's my insurance, should she default.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.330
If you want it back, then repay me
for all the food you borrowed.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.630
Enshou, please!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.710
I'm begging you.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.120
I refuse.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:15.770
Normally, I'd say that, but I'm bored.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:20.220
If you can defeat us in a game,
I'll return it to you!

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.560
A game?

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.960
<b>First Battle for the Sword</b>

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:33.610
The battle for the sword, begun at Enshou-sama's
whim, is about to commence!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.940
Who will be victorious?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:39.460
Will it be the elegant, beautiful Enshou-sama
of the famous En family?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.730
Or the poverty-stricken viceroy that
no one remembers, Kousonsan?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.880
Why, that little...

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:48.800
The first match begins right after this!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.940
<b>The first match begins right after this!!</b>

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.610
Wow, she wasn't kidding!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:09:00.970
Our first match is a test of knowledge
between Ganryou and Shokatsuryou!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.490
Shuri may have a flat chest,
but she's really smart!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.350
She won't lose to someone
with a 34 mind stat!

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.320
<i>...may have a flat chest...</i>

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.390
<i>...a flat chest...</i>

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:12.310
...chest...

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.250
Don't think that Toshi's mind
stat will stay 34 forever.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:20.210
She read all the books that Reiha-sama
gave her, and it went up to 36!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:24.550
Lately, both her mind stat and her
waistline have been going up-

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.410
You're not helping!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:32.840
The category for round one's battle of
knowledge is Enshou-sama's secrets!

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:38.730
Question 1! What color is Enshou-sama's
underwear today?

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.090
Black!

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:41.820
Correct!

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:40.930
<b>Zero</b>

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:41.780
<b>One</b>

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:51.960
<b>One</b>

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:51.980
<b>Zero</b>

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:49.230
Question 2! What magic spell does Enshou-sama
perform before bedtime to avoid bad dreams?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.980
She turns her pillow over
and hits it three times.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.630
Correct!

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:59.760
<b>Two</b>

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:59.760
<b>Zero</b>

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:58.520
Question 3! When was the
last time she went #2?

00:09:59.010 --> 00:09:59.790
Three days ago.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.480
Correct!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.240
<b>Two</b>

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.180
<b>Three</b>

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.940
And now, the final question!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:23.490
How old was Enshou-sama when
she stopped wetting her bed?

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:24.740
Twelve.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.760
Correct!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:31.150
100 to 0!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.680
Ganryou wins a flawless victory!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.620
She got us.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:40.350
I'm sorry. It wasn't a topic I
was at all interested in...

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:41.620
It can't be helped.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:45.090
It was all stuff no one would
want to know, anyway.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:50.060
Why do I feel vaguely ill,
despite our having won?

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:53.010
You're imagining things!

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:56.710
Our second match is eel-catching!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:01.870
The winner is the one who catches
the most eels in this pool!

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:05.190
However, you're not allowed to use
your hands to catch the eels!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:09.840
You must catch them between
your breasts!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.020
Aisha, that's you.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.640
Why are you looking at me like
I'm the obvious choice?

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:19.030
Show them the power of the well-endowed!

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:25.700
That's right... This competition is far
too difficult for me or Rin Rin-chan.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.820
Shuri too?!

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.300
What's wrong?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.820
Decide who's going to do it.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.920
Or are you going to forfeit?

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.860
I'll go!

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:42.340
But Ryuubi-dono...

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:46.260
The purpose of this fight
is to regain my sword.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.980
I can't let you do it all yourselves!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.990
All right, get ready!

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:08.370
Hey, don't run away!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:09.970
Wait!

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.360
Stay put!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:18.280
Not there!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.810
No, it's too big!

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:25.930
<i>D-Don't move!</i>

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.130
8.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.400
9.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.560
10.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.880
11.

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.000
12.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.050
13.

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:34.470
The results are in!

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:38.410
With a score of 13 to 11,
the winner is Ryuubi!

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.270
Bigger really is better!

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:41.050
All right!

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:42.780
They're exposed! They're exposed!

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.160
Good match, Toshi.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.120
Iishe.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:53.770
If only the game had been to grab them with your
belly rolls, you'd have had the bigger advantage.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:57.530
I would not!

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.500
Match three!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.950
Arm wrestling!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.180
Match four!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.750
Tongue twisters!

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.380
Yuan Shao sells seashells by the seashore!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.040
Yuan Shao sells seashells by the seashore!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.480
Yuan Shao sells seashells by the seashore!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.830
Imitations!

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:21.020
My chest is flat, but my belly sticks out!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:23.400
<i>I'd never say that!</i>

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:29.170
Toshi, have you put on some weight?

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.440
What's in the box?

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.150
It's moving!

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:36.340
It was wet and slippery!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.380
Staring contest!

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:42.990
Bean carrying!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.670
And next...

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:51.720
Clam-matching!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.720
<b>Clam-matching!</b>

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.530
I'm not really sure what you're thinking of,

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:59.270
but clam-matching is a nobleman's
game in which you split a bunch

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:02.430
of clamshells apart, separate
them, and then match them.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:04.760
It's nothing naughty.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.090
I-I wasn't...

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.100
Cosplay competition!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.330
I don't really know if I like this...

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.100
Smile, Koumei-chan! Smile!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.390
That's right, Shuri.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.300
We get points for a good impression.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.260
You can shake Rin Rin's hand live!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.210
Why do I have to do this?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:37.970
We've had many challenges today,
and the score is a tie: 150 to 150!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:41.960
The last match awaits. What will it be?

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:46.490
And in the end, who will attain
the glory of victory?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:50.070
I guess I have no choice
but to enter myself.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.080
The final match will be...

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:57.530
ladies' sumo wrestling while wearing the
famous En-family swan loincloth!

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.080
Aisha.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.000
Stop doing that!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.710
I-I know, Rin Rin, why don't
you take this one?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:10.760
I'd be fine with just a loincloth, but I'm
not really up for the whole swan thing.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.850
Then Ryuubi-dono...

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:17.010
Mother's dying wish was that I never sumo
wrestle while wearing a swan loincloth!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.140
Your mom's alive!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.980
Give up, Aisha!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.010
Hold it!

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.270
I shall go!

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:25.580
Pairen-chan!

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:28.950
This is partially my responsibility.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.660
Leave this to me.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:31.930
But...

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:34.610
Don't worry, I thought this might happen,

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:40.610
so I brought a white horse loincloth, befitting
my name as the White Horse General.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.700
I shall not lose to any mere swan!

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.600
That's not really the issue.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:12.820
You, wreathed in white loincloths, are now
to stand on the hard soil-colored ground.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.220
Old woman...

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:19.800
No matter who wins this battle, the result
will be carved into the annals of history.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.700
Let's get going!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.300
Ready! Set...

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.390
Go!

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:34.710
The two have struck head-on!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:38.430
Not bad.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.650
But how about this?

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:45.060
Enshou strikes with a fierce attack!

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.520
But Kousonsan is still in the game!

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:49.700
I can see it...

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.990
Even my old, blind eyes can see it.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.370
What a fierce battle!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:59.070
Now I'll show you my true power!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.410
Toshi, the swan's eyes turned bright red!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.070
Reiha-sama is serious!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:15.080
Look at the naughty... I mean, the
powerful hip thrusts of Enshou!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.000
Is this... Is this the power
of an ancient clan?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.220
Am I done for?

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:26.230
Will it end for me here...
A poor girl no one remembers or notices?

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.360
It was always, always like that.

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:34.490
No matter how high I raised my hand,
the teacher never called on me.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:41.410
Even when I went shopping with my parents,
they'd forget I existed and leave me behind.

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:45.660
All those days when my only friend
was my white horse...

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.330
What's wrong, Sei?

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:56.710
Hakukei-dono's heart is beginning
to fill with negative ki.

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.300
Wh-What's going to happen?

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:05.260
Given how small she is,
when that negative energy overflows,

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.750
it will become an incredible power!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:14.210
Secret Technique: White Horse Comet Fist!

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:31.250
Th-The winner is Kousonsan!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.120
I won!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:36.790
I won!

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:40.750
Now no one will be able to forget me!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:45.750
That's true. She's left an impression that
will follow her for the rest of her life.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:46.990
Y-Yeah...

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.100
Is this really an OK ending?

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:50.950
Y-Yeah, I guess so.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.020
She seems happy.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:52.410
I did it!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.020
I did it!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.940
<i>I did it!</i>

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.770
What?

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.500
The sword isn't here?

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.020
What do you mean?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:09.000
Actually, a messenger came from Reiha-sama's
cousin, Enjutsu-sama, yesterday...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.030
Hello, Choukun-san.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.080
Is Miu-san doing well?

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.210
Yeah, so well that she's hard
to keep a handle on.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.160
Glad to hear that.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.340
So what brings you here today?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:25.440
We heard that you'd acquired
a splendid sword.

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:28.230
Oh, my. People are talking
about it already?

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.130
Yes.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:34.610
My lord is very interested and
asked me to offer you this

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:40.020
extremely rare robe, that idiots
can't see, in exchange.

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:43.020
There's nothing there.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:48.830
Enshou-sama, you're not saying
you can't see it, are you?

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:51.780
D-Don't be silly!

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.730
Of course I can see it!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.550
Of course!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:00.950
This color, this feel... This lovely pattern...

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:05.800
You could search the capitol of Rakuyou for
years and never find such a splendid robe.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.730
Th-That's true.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.980
It's beautiful.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.260
Iishe, you think so, too, right?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:15.180
It's truly splendid...

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:19.240
Then you'll trade it for
the sword, won't you?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:22.910
And so we did.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.000
I stopped them!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.120
But Reiha-sama...

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.040
But then why did you agree to a game?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.290
I had to!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.500
I didn't think I was going to lose!

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.260
It's your fault for winning.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.510
Enshou! Why, you...

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:41.890
Fine.

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:44.910
You won. So Kousonsan-san,

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.850
you can forget about having to pay
me back for the food I lent you.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.290
Now we're even, right?

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.230
That's not the issue!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.330
I-

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:57.710
But Touka...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:20:59.450
Enshou-san.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:01.300
Wh-What?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:03.730
I'm going to go see Enjutsu-san.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:09.420
I'll have her return the blade to me herself.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.560
I-I see...

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.100
Understood.

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:18.300
I'll write a letter explaining
the matter. Take it and go.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:27.960
But it's late, so you can stay here tonight.

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.270
What are you doing?

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.860
Get the banquet ready!

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:35.800
I'm going to change.

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:39.970
While I do, prepare our best wine and food.

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:40.800
Right!

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.570
This is a feast!

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:50.540
Well, we'll be going.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:53.760
Kousonsan-dono, you've been very helpful.

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.830
Touka, be careful on your way.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.510
I'll be praying you get your sword back.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:01.390
Thank you, Paipai-chan!

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:03.960
Don't get it wrong.

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:06.230
It's Pairen!

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:08.810
Let's get going ourselves.

00:22:08.810 --> 00:22:10.630
Um, everyone?

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:15.230
I've heard that it's a long way to
the town Enjutsu-san rules.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:19.570
Is it really OK for you to go so far?

00:22:19.970 --> 00:22:23.100
If it's troublesome, I can go alone...

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:27.030
No, it's too late for that.

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:28.780
We've already started.

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:30.210
We'll follow you to the end.

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:31.030
Indeed.

00:22:32.770 --> 00:22:34.090
All of you...

00:22:34.090 --> 00:22:38.670
You know what they say, the more...

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:39.740
The more...

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:42.270
The more you know it's going to be merrier!

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:44.160
That's it!

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:53.640
Why... Why is everyone laughing?

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:27.630
Iishe, what do you think?

00:24:27.630 --> 00:24:31.150
This robe that idiots can't see...
Does it look good on me?

00:24:31.150 --> 00:24:37.180
It looks great! Especially that little
pink pouch on the chest.

00:24:37.180 --> 00:24:39.470
Of course! Of course!

00:24:39.470 --> 00:24:43.240
Now that I'm feeling good,
let's do the preview.

00:24:43.240 --> 00:24:46.480
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime Musou,</i> Episode 4:

00:24:46.480 --> 00:24:50.230
The Three Chou Sisters Acquire the
"Crucial Keys to the Way of Peace."

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:55.170
Huh, I wonder why I'm tearing
up. I can't see...

00:24:50.550 --> 00:24:55.180
<b>Episode 4
The Three Chou Sisters Acquire the
"Crucial Keys to the Way of Peace."</b>

00:24:55.190 --> 00:25:00.100
